(7394239, 1162832, 159723, '<td valign="top">Wonderful street photography! Not often I see a street photo in color that I like! Awesome!</td>', 'Wonderful street photography! Not often I see a street photo in color that I like! Awesome!', '2015-08-01 11:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394240, 1162783, 159723, '<td valign="top">Hello Daisy! Your photographer did a marvellous job. You look great!</td>', 'Hello Daisy! Your photographer did a marvellous job. You look great!', '2015-08-01 11:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394241, 1162848, 159723, '<td valign="top">The connection with the red head is great! The blond becomes a bit of a distraction for me, but not so much that my eyes are drawn away from the red head.</td>', 'The connection with the red head is great! The blond becomes a bit of a distraction for me, but not so much that my eyes are drawn away from the red head.', '2015-08-01 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394242, 1162882, 159723, '<td valign="top">Have no idea what I am looking at, but I enjoy looking at it! Nice light and pleasant muted colours.</td>', 'Have no idea what I am looking at, but I enjoy looking at it! Nice light and pleasant muted colours.', '2015-08-01 11:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394244, 1161183, 159723, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! There is a bit too much saturation and clarity in the vines for my taste. In my view it does not quite match the soft horizon and hillside.</td>', 'Nice capture! There is a bit too much saturation and clarity in the vines for my taste. In my view it does not quite match the soft horizon and hillside.', '2015-08-01 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394246, 1162926, 159723, '<td valign="top">My favourite technically and artistically! The level of detail, yet modes amount of noise, is impressive considering that it is dark (I''m assuming no extra lighting was used). I hope you have written a story in the description, because I would love the know the story :) Best of luck!</td>', 'My favourite technically and artistically! The level of detail, yet modes amount of noise, is impressive considering that it is dark (I''m assuming no extra lighting was used). I hope you have written a story in the description, because I would love the know the story :) Best of luck!', '2015-08-01 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394248, 1162885, 159723, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! A lot of the images of sunflowers that I have seen look very "stock photo-ish". This does not. interesting choice of area to focus on :)</td>', 'Nice capture! A lot of the images of sunflowers that I have seen look very "stock photo-ish". This does not. interesting choice of area to focus on :)', '2015-08-01 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394249, 1162933, 159723, '<td valign="top">In my view there is a little bit too much clarity and saturation in the foreground, but I suppose because there is so much foreground leaving it darker may attract attention away from the lovely mountains in the background.</td>', 'In my view there is a little bit too much clarity and saturation in the foreground, but I suppose because there is so much foreground leaving it darker may attract attention away from the lovely mountains in the background.', '2015-08-01 11:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394250, 1162892, 159723, '<td valign="top">I can''t make up my mind if I think the fog looks real or not. Still, nice mate colours and darkening the bottom corners help direct my attention to the three.</td>', 'I can''t make up my mind if I think the fog looks real or not. Still, nice mate colours and darkening the bottom corners help direct my attention to the three.', '2015-08-01 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394252, 1162931, 159723, '<td valign="top">Nice natural feeling! I would prefer the face a bit sharper. My eyes are instead drawn towards her chest tattoo.</td>', 'Nice natural feeling! I would prefer the face a bit sharper. My eyes are instead drawn towards her chest tattoo.', '2015-08-01 11:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394255, 1162504, 159723, '<td valign="top">The lady bugs and the barley they are on look great, but for me there is not enough separating features between the foreground and background, if that made sense.</td>', 'The lady bugs and the barley they are on look great, but for me there is not enough separating features between the foreground and background, if that made sense.', '2015-08-01 11:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394256, 1159855, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great capture! There is no doubt where my eyes go first in this image. Perhaps little less exposure in the tail could make the bird stand out even more from the background?</td>', 'Great capture! There is no doubt where my eyes go first in this image. Perhaps little less exposure in the tail could make the bird stand out even more from the background?', '2015-08-01 11:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394257, 1159461, 159723, '<td valign="top">WOW! I''m speechless! Congrats on your ribbon :)</td>', 'WOW! I''m speechless! Congrats on your ribbon :)', '2015-08-01 11:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394258, 1162738, 159723, '<td valign="top">I have to admit my first reaction was not great! Hehe... But the more I look at it, the more I like it. Is it a photographic masterpiece? No, but it is fun, whimsical, it made my laugh and it celebrates things worth celebrating :)</td>', 'I have to admit my first reaction was not great! Hehe... But the more I look at it, the more I like it. Is it a photographic masterpiece? No, but it is fun, whimsical, it made my laugh and it celebrates things worth celebrating :)', '2015-08-01 12:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394264, 1159452, 77543, '<td valign="top">text</td>', 'text', '2015-08-01 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394266, 1162649, 177322, '<td valign="top">And, don''t they just love the lantana? And, if you have Russian Sage, they will be there in swarms.  I''ve come to know these critters as Clearwing Sphinx Moths but there is always they nano-second when they look like the fat bumble bees that enjoy the same blossoms, yet, they forage like hummingbirds.  Delightful picture.</td>', 'And, don''t they just love the lantana? And, if you have Russian Sage, they will be there in swarms.  I''ve come to know these critters as Clearwing Sphinx Moths but there is always they nano-second when they look like the fat bumble bees that enjoy the same blossoms, yet, they forage like hummingbirds.  Delightful picture.', '2015-08-01 13:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394291, 1162702, 159723, '<td valign="top">To me it is a bit too soft and you haven''t quite nailed the edge of the fur against the black background. As it is now the mama cat looks a bit like she is floating. Good effort though! I know how hard it is to get hair and fur right and you have done a much better job than i could have.</td>', 'To me it is a bit too soft and you haven''t quite nailed the edge of the fur against the black background. As it is now the mama cat looks a bit like she is floating. Good effort though! I know how hard it is to get hair and fur right and you have done a much better job than i could have.', '2015-08-01 18:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
