(7394939, 1162884, 19944, '<td valign="top">I suspect you flipped this image.  The newspaper is a giveaway.</td>', 'I suspect you flipped this image.  The newspaper is a giveaway.', '2015-08-04 13:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394971, 1162924, 91783, '<td valign="top">the primary subject feels muddy in color and clarity, and I think because of the white balance that you have going on here. clean that up and it could be a real winner!</td>', 'the primary subject feels muddy in color and clarity, and I think because of the white balance that you have going on here. clean that up and it could be a real winner!', '2015-08-04 18:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394972, 1161066, 91783, '<td valign="top">first looking at the image i thought your subject was the sky, but with your title, it becomes the land. If your intentions were the land, then possibly ask yourself about the land to sky ratio. To me it feels unbalanced. The halo on the trees and hills are little much for me too. <br/> <br/>Although! Good solid effort. Lanscape photography can be challenging!</td>', 'first looking at the image i thought your subject was the sky, but with your title, it becomes the land. If your intentions were the land, then possibly ask yourself about the land to sky ratio. To me it feels unbalanced. The halo on the trees and hills are little much for me too.  Although! Good solid effort. Lanscape photography can be challenging!', '2015-08-04 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394974, 1160121, 91783, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy your choice of black and white. It turns the image into a story piece instead of just a portrait which creates intrigue for the viewer. For me, i think that the image is in the muddy middle of being a little too blurry. Whether its not sharp enough, or not blurry enough to create a more abstract image. Regardless its an interesting image. good luck!</td>', 'I really enjoy your choice of black and white. It turns the image into a story piece instead of just a portrait which creates intrigue for the viewer. For me, i think that the image is in the muddy middle of being a little too blurry. Whether its not sharp enough, or not blurry enough to create a more abstract image. Regardless its an interesting image. good luck!', '2015-08-04 18:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394975, 1162723, 91783, '<td valign="top">what a sweet photo! I love baby pigs! <br/> <br/>the sharpness and clarity that you have with the piglets are really great, though momma is a little soft for my taste. You could up your aperture and get the whole family in clear focus or lower it and put more of the emphasis on the babies. It may even create more interest if you got lower to ground and gave an interesting perspective. <br/> <br/>Still a really lovely image! good luck!</td>', 'what a sweet photo! I love baby pigs!  the sharpness and clarity that you have with the piglets are really great, though momma is a little soft for my taste. You could up your aperture and get the whole family in clear focus or lower it and put more of the emphasis on the babies. It may even create more interest if you got lower to ground and gave an interesting perspective.  Still a really lovely image! good luck!', '2015-08-04 18:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7394976, 1162798, 91783, '<td valign="top">very interesting story you have created here with such a simple image. Really great choice of black and white, as it simplifies the image further. good luck!</td>', 'very interesting story you have created here with such a simple image. Really great choice of black and white, as it simplifies the image further. good luck!', '2015-08-04 18:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
