(7395696, 1162688, 81362, '<td valign="top">Somehow this sunset stands above the countless other ho hum examples. Unusual for me to score any sunset higher than six, but this one gets there. Good job holding a bit of detail in the grass and trees.</td>', 'Somehow this sunset stands above the countless other ho hum examples. Unusual for me to score any sunset higher than six, but this one gets there. Good job holding a bit of detail in the grass and trees.', '2015-08-07 08:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7395698, 1162829, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and enjoyable bit of detail maintained in the mountains. Sad that most people live where light pollution make the stars invisible.</td>', 'Beautiful image and enjoyable bit of detail maintained in the mountains. Sad that most people live where light pollution make the stars invisible.', '2015-08-07 08:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7395701, 1162861, 81362, '<td valign="top">Quite a good job of including motion blur to convey the sensation of busy motion embodied in this toddler. Good counter example to those who think sharpness is the first requirement of an excellent image.</td>', 'Quite a good job of including motion blur to convey the sensation of busy motion embodied in this toddler. Good counter example to those who think sharpness is the first requirement of an excellent image.', '2015-08-07 08:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7395703, 1159291, 81362, '<td valign="top">Soft flower contrasting with rocks makes a good starting place, and having the rocks light color and smooth provides a good contrast to the usual idea of "rock." I find the dark line between the wood boards to be an element that doesn''t fit with the rest of the composition as well as a solid wood background likely available by setting up a bit to either side. To my eye, greater depth of field (narrower aperture or focus stacking) to keep all the stones sharp would have been stronger, but that is a subjective decision.</td>', 'Soft flower contrasting with rocks makes a good starting place, and having the rocks light color and smooth provides a good contrast to the usual idea of "rock." I find the dark line between the wood boards to be an element that doesn''t fit with the rest of the composition as well as a solid wood background likely available by setting up a bit to either side. To my eye, greater depth of field (narrower aperture or focus stacking) to keep all the stones sharp would have been stronger, but that is a subjective decision.', '2015-08-07 08:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7395704, 1160016, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a situation in which black and white treatment reduces background distractions. The vignette may be a little too noticeable, introducing an element that competes for attention. With the sky empty, a square crop could be a way to give additional prominence to the car.</td>', 'Looks like a situation in which black and white treatment reduces background distractions. The vignette may be a little too noticeable, introducing an element that competes for attention. With the sky empty, a square crop could be a way to give additional prominence to the car.', '2015-08-07 08:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
