(7395799, 1162638, 103142, '<td valign="top">oh this is so very cool, and awesome lighting, but the crop really is giving me a hard time. 9 with either getting the feet, or cropping it up on the jeans more. Showing just a hint of them makes it look like a mistake instead of a conscious decision.<br/> <br/>Also, I adore negative space, but it doesn''t work for me on this one. I would have loved having more space for the soul to sink into. Or even less space for the soul to move out of the frame. But the large amount of negative space on the left just shows that the space on the right is rather conventional. The combination of the two doesn''t work.<br/> <br/>That being said, the lighting, the position, the rest is truly wonderful.</td>', 'oh this is so very cool, and awesome lighting, but the crop really is giving me a hard time. 9 with either getting the feet, or cropping it up on the jeans more. Showing just a hint of them makes it look like a mistake instead of a conscious decision. Also, I adore negative space, but it doesn''t work for me on this one. I would have loved having more space for the soul to sink into. Or even less space for the soul to move out of the frame. But the large amount of negative space on the left just shows that the space on the right is rather conventional. The combination of the two doesn''t work. That being said, the lighting, the position, the rest is truly wonderful.', '2015-08-07 15:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7395800, 1162672, 103142, '<td valign="top">I adore this one, but somethings just not right. I don''t know if I want it cropped lower so that half of the sign doesn''t show in the upper left. I don''t want it cropped too tight, because I love the feel of the story. But I think getting rid of the guys head and the yellow sign would leave less for the eye to get distracted with.</td>', 'I adore this one, but somethings just not right. I don''t know if I want it cropped lower so that half of the sign doesn''t show in the upper left. I don''t want it cropped too tight, because I love the feel of the story. But I think getting rid of the guys head and the yellow sign would leave less for the eye to get distracted with.', '2015-08-07 15:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
