(7395946, 1162877, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cuttooth:</b></div><hr/><i> Great job Jake.  I was on edge all week because I knew yours was doing really well.<br/>Congrats on the Red! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Mark.  I can''t complain - it''s my best finish ever in FS, and now I get to post one of these to my profile. :)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=513809" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43774/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_513809.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43774/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_513809.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43774/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_513809.gif"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Cuttooth: Great job Jake.  I was on edge all week because I knew yours was doing really well.Congrats on the Red!   Thanks, Mark.  I can''t complain - it''s my best finish ever in FS, and now I get to post one of these to my profile. :) ', '2015-08-08 07:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
